<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    O/N = -----				    O/N = 6.40%</p>
<p>	    T/N = 5.12%				    T/N = -----</p>
<p>		   Sep 2, 1996			 Aug 30, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  6.48%	1 month forward =  7.50%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  8.53%	2 month forward =  9.38%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  9.10%	3 month forward =  9.66%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  9.64%	4 month forward =  9.97%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward = 10.51%	5 month forward = 10.84%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward = 10.49%	6 month forward = 10.90%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
